  + 0.20 dex floor on M_bar propagated with the local slope dlog g_pred/dlog g_bar; Re error, inclination, distance NOT propagated.
  KMOS3D cross-match: 117 of 135 Ubler rows matched uniquely to catalogue R_half; ledger rows 23, with M+R+V: 5

